<title>UK: BAA retail director to be Littlewoods CEO.</title>
<headline>BAA retail director to be Littlewoods CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British airport operator BAA Plc said on Monday its group retail director, Barry Gibson, was leaving the company to become group chief executive of Littlewoods Organisation Plc.</p>
